\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  O my spirit do be sober,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 And thank you the Lord your God.
\par His goodness and love remember,
\par This day and each other day.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par He, with love and with goodness\tab 
\par Guard me through the gloomy nights
\par And so the might of the devil
\par Can never have effect on me.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. In your name, my Lord and master
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 Do I begin my travels
\par O receive me and bid me to
\par \pard\li135\sl190\slmult0   Tread your path which is perfect.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6   Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par As was done by men of old
\par  Who your given laws obeyed
\par   Your path bid me perfectly tread,
\par   And finally get to heaven.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Make us all take us our target
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 The holy city above
\par It is there that evil actions,
\par Troubles and pains don't exist
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par It is there that you, with love
\par Care for us to our comfort
\par In you we have expectations
\par That you'll care for us for ever
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  In accordance with your order,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj Make it continue to be
\par Where I shall go, where I shall lodge
\par You, I expect, direct me.
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj Do protect me from tempest,
\par From the thunder and the (wind),
\par For you only are the mighty;
\par \pard      There is no mighty hand like Thee.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

